WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.230
Stuck on a screen? Don't worry, I've got you. Here's how to get help, wherever you are.

2
00:00:07.353 --> 00:00:14.693
Every screen has a gold Help button. Press it for a short guide to that screen: what it's for, and how to do things.

3
00:00:16.131 --> 00:00:23.181
Or press Show me how, and I'll walk you round it, pointing at each part. Press Next whenever you're ready.

4
00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:35.898
Know it already? Skip this screen, or the whole tour. And if I'm in the way, Hide card tucks me out of sight.

5
00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:43.164
Want the whole lot? Take the full tour, pick one chapter, or choose any screen from the list.

6
00:00:50.745 --> 00:00:54.765
However you like to learn, I'm right here. Just press Help.
